write:             set v2 on eu primary
read, in window:   "v2" from eu primary
read, after:       "v1" from eu replica 0
                   the stale read above is a stand-in for replication lag; replication is out of scope
read, Primary:     "v2" from eu primary
insert:            "us note" for org 2 on us primary
  file eu         [v2]
  file eu-replica [v1]
  file us         [us note]
no shard:          ErrNoShard=true
  velox: gen.Note: no shard for the statement: the context has no WithShard, and WithShardFor named none
WithShard:         1 note on us (err=<nil>)
